  "description": "Kim Mi-Yeong, a single woman in her mid-thirties, was enjoying a comfortable, carefree single life when she suddenly felt left behind by the news of her friends’ weddings. Filled with a sense of crisis that she might end up dying alone if things continued this way, Mi-Yeong sets out to find a husband, trying everything from dating apps and blind dates to clubs and matchmaking agencies. However, opportunities to meet new men are few and far between, and when she does manage to meet someone, she tends to notice their flaws first. Yet she can’t bring herself to compromise easily just for the sake of marriage. \n\n*“Will I ever meet a good man to marry?”\n“But what exactly is a ‘good man’?”\n“How do I want to live my life?”*\n\nAmid countless questions about marriage, this is the story of her journey to find the ending that’s right for her.\n\n(Source: KakaoPage, translated)",
